 "summary": "The PR removes the duplicated `reduction` tower and its lemmas by defining `reduction`, `reduction\u03c0` and `toLimReduction` as abbreviations of the general `quotients` construction, and moves the universal-property API into `Quotient.lean` in general form. The one new helper, `Ideal.pow_succ_smul_top_antitone`, has no Mathlib counterpart (grep finds only `Submodule.pow_smul_top_le`) and is used six times; `quotientsLiftEquiv` is built the same way as `IsAdicSystem.limQuotientEquiv`, but this is a small generic combinator kept for a stated module-boundary reason.",
